  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "義大利國際建築實作學習",
    "sub_ename": "PRACTICAL TRAINING AT THE WAVE WORKSHOP",
    "describe_ch": "義大利WAVe工作營是義大利建築專業領域最大的暑假活動之一。每年有超過10個國家、1100位以上的學生參與這個活動。這個工作營每年都會提出一個操作主題，提供學生所學的建築專業知識運用於不同文化氛圍的場域。本課程將涵蓋多元領域，包括新興科技對建築的影響、數位與實體空間的整合、永續發展策略，以及適應性工作環境的設計等。",
    "describe_eh": "The WAVe Workshop in Italy is one of the largest summer events in the field of architecture in Italy. Each year, more than 1,100 students from over 10 countries participate in this workshop. WAVe proposes a new operational theme annually, providing students with the opportunity to apply their architectural knowledge in different cultural contexts. This program covers a wide range of fields, including the impact of emerging technologies on architecture, the integration of digital and physical spaces, sustainable development strategies, and the design of adaptive work environments.",
